MotionKnowledge does not redistribute HyperFrames source code or assets.
The sandboxed specialist-render container in docker/hyperframes/ is an
independent implementation that renders bounded HTML/SVG scenes with
headless Chromium and FFmpeg. HeyGen trademarks are not used.

This container image additionally includes:
- Node.js (MIT), distributed in node:24-alpine
- Chromium (BSD-3-Clause), Alpine package
- FFmpeg (LGPL/GPL), Alpine package

